<title>USA: Mississippi to sell $140.5 million GOs on July 1.</title>
<headline>Mississippi to sell $140.5 million GOs on July 1.</headline>
<dateline>JACKSON, Miss. 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mississippi will sell $140.505 million of general obligation bonds by competitive bid on July 1 at 11 a.m. CDT (Noon EDT), the State Bond Commission said.</p>
<p>The bonds are Capital Improvement Issue, Series 1997A, and have maturities out to 20 years.</p>
<p>((--Jane Sutton, 305-374-5013))</p>
